  "title": "Pandita Ramabai",
  "summary": "Pandita Ramabai set up Sharada Sadan, a home of learning for women, in 1889 and later built the Mukti Mission at Kedgaon, about 30 miles from Pune. Born in 1858, she worked for the education and shelter of women and girls, including famine-hit girls. She died in 1922.",
