  "reviewer_note": "The sources disagree on where Sharada Sadan opened (Bombay per Zubaan, Pune per Christian History), so no place is stated for it. Neither source gives a Mukti founding year. The Zubaan page also dates her Bible translation after its stated death year. Pin is the OSM Kedgaon town node (Daund), matched only by distance from Pune.",
